  "title": "Request a Tentative Hold on a Venue (Coordinator)",
  "note": "Scope includes the coordinator request path and the minimum shared Venue Staff approval check required by Jira AC8: competing Pending tentative holds must not block the first approval, and an approved winner blocks overlapping approvals. This does not implement the broader SPM-132 approval lifecycle. Maintained Confluence matrix page 34603557 includes all VEN-HOLD-01..13 cases; every PRIMARY ID has a focused call site. PostgreSQL integration cases require the local test database. Review-correction pass (2026-10-27) adds supporting IDs for the events-module reading of approved holds (VEN-HOLD-04-SUP-EVENTS), the unconditional 336-hour recheck on approval (VEN-HOLD-03-SUP-RECHECK), the unavailable-period listing (VEN-HOLD-04-SUP-BLOCKOUT) and approved-hold submission and approval conflicts (VEN-HOLD-07-SUP-APPROVED-HOLD, VEN-HOLD-08-SUP-APPROVAL-EXPIRED).",
